      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Array is a linear Data Structure .\n\n2. Collection of multiple values of same type .\n\n3. It stores data in contigious location in memory .\n\n4. Index starting from zero and end at size-1 .\n\nWhy Array index start from zero .\n==============================\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Array is a linear Data Structure .\n\n2. Collection of multiple values of same type .\n\n3. It stores data in contigious location in memory .\n\n4. Index starting from zero and end at size-1 .\n\nWhy Array index start from zero .\n==============================\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
